{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T17:17:44.853Z","ordinal":36391,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a08c53-4e15-7893-aca5-101bed919e06","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"The TUI is bad for doing this. Make it way simpler: Remove the queue list, show the statement under review, what the filter decided, the judges decisions and why (in a way I can quickly grasp it), skip jugdes that weren't available, then ask me at the bottom if I agree with the judges or not. Stores these decisions and then we can discuss what we do with those I didn't agree with."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08c52-627e-72c2-ad24-e4d4de487a71"}}}
